<title>USA: Universal Stainless stake cut by investor.</title>
<headline>Universal Stainless stake cut by investor.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Edelson Technology Partners III LP, a Woodcliff Lake, N.J. investment firm, said Monday it has reduced its stake in Universal Stainless &amp; Alloy Products Inc to 312,500 shares or a 4.9 percent stake.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the firm said it most recently sold a net 107,000 shares at an average price of $13.29 each.</p>
